</div>
<p>I'd like to take a moment and thank SCPD for giving me this absurd and ridiculous concept. As you can probably tell, this was inspired by several aspects of Scott Cawthons <em>Five Nights At Freddy's</em> series, and something I'm personally quite happy with.</p>
<p>I'd like to also thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5950867); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1589660997" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5950867); return false;">KaraKatt</a></span> for dedicating the time and effort into making this possible. Without Kara this might not have ever happened. They put in a crazy amount of work into it, so I'm glad I could help them out with their first SCP!</p>
<p>Other than that? I'm surprised this thing is still floating.</p>

